    "long_instructions": "##Exploration: Choose Your Own Co-Creation\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Task:\r\n\r\n* **Describe** your own idea for a chatbot that supports one of your purposes.\r\n* **Test** the output to see how well it helps with your purpose.\r\n* **Judge** what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n\r\n_**Prompt example:**_\r\n\r\n_I want you to help me come up with interesting names for basketball plays. I will describe the play and you give me some ideas for funny, cool names._\r\n",
